        "namePattern": "^Microsoft Access database engine 2016"
      },
      "eol": "2025-10-14",
      "eolSeverity": "High",
      "replacement": "Microsoft 365 Access Runtime",
      "advice": "Support ended with Office 2016 on 14 October 2025. It is normally installed by an app that imports Access or Excel data. Check with that vendor, then replace it with the Microsoft 365 Access Runtime (same ACE OLE DB / ODBC drivers) and remove the 2016 engine.",
