      "id": "keylogger-spyware",
      "category": "Keylogger / covert monitoring",
      "concern": "High",
      "purpose": "Records keystrokes, screenshots, messages or browsing, often hidden from the user.",
      "advisory": "Covert monitoring software is rarely legitimate on business devices and is also used by attackers. Confirm who installed it and why; if it is not an approved, disclosed tool, isolate the device and investigate.",
